{
  "@id": "https://ontola.github.io/atomic-plugins/ontology/lenses/solid-bookmark-v1",
  "lensFormat": 1,
  "release": "https://ontola.github.io/atomic-plugins/ontology/lenses/v1",
  "name": "Solid bookmark ↔ Bookmark",
  "description": "An RDF bookmark node in expanded JSON-LD (a Solid Pod document) and the host's built-in Bookmark class: its dcterms:title literal and its bookmark:recalls link.",
  "source": {
    "rdf": "http://www.w3.org/2002/01/bookmark#Bookmark"
  },
  "target": {
    "class": "https://atomicdata.dev/class/Bookmark"
  },
  "mapping": {
    "version": 2,
    "fields": [
      {
        "source": "/http:~1~1purl.org~1dc~1terms~1title/0/@value",
        "target": "https://atomicdata.dev/properties/name"
      },
      {
        "source": "/http:~1~1www.w3.org~12002~101~1bookmark#recalls/0/@id",
        "target": "https://atomicdata.dev/property/url"
      }
    ]
  },
  "limits": [
    "Only the dcterms:title and bookmark:recalls predicates: the code lens also reads rdfs:label and as:name titles, as:url links, links written as literals, and the bookmark#BookMark and as:Note types, and refuses a node with two title or two link predicates.",
    "No domain guard on the RDF objects: the code lens refuses literals with other datatypes, several objects for one predicate and links that are not absolute http(s) URLs.",
    "The result is a changed node, not a Pod write: a host still needs the document's ETag and, where present, its CRDT protocol."
  ],
  "implementation": "integrations/solid/devonian/bookmarks/lens/index.ts",
  "examples": [
    {
      "source": {
        "@id": "https://pod.example/bookmarks/index.ttl#one",
        "@type": [
          "http://www.w3.org/2002/01/bookmark#Bookmark"
        ],
        "http://purl.org/dc/terms/title": [
          {
            "@value": "Original",
            "@language": "nl"
          }
        ],
        "http://www.w3.org/2002/01/bookmark#recalls": [
          {
            "@id": "https://example.org/article"
          }
        ],
        "http://www.w3.org/2002/01/bookmark#hasTopic": [
          {
            "@value": "Invented topic"
          }
        ]
      },
      "target": {
        "https://atomicdata.dev/properties/name": "Original",
        "https://atomicdata.dev/property/url": "https://example.org/article"
      },
      "edits": [
        {
          "target": {
            "https://atomicdata.dev/properties/name": "Changed",
            "https://atomicdata.dev/property/url": "https://example.org/next"
          },
          "source": {
            "@id": "https://pod.example/bookmarks/index.ttl#one",
            "@type": [
              "http://www.w3.org/2002/01/bookmark#Bookmark"
            ],
            "http://purl.org/dc/terms/title": [
              {
                "@value": "Changed",
                "@language": "nl"
              }
            ],
            "http://www.w3.org/2002/01/bookmark#recalls": [
              {
                "@id": "https://example.org/next"
              }
            ],
            "http://www.w3.org/2002/01/bookmark#hasTopic": [
              {
                "@value": "Invented topic"
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
